msgstr "Error sa pagpili ng camera"

#: src/onboarding.py:560
msgid "The selected camera cannot be opened"
msgstr "Hindi mabuksan ang napiling camera"

#: src/onboarding.py:560
msgid "Try to select another one"
msgstr "Subukang pumili ng isa pa"

#: src/onboarding.py:575
msgid ""
"Please visit\n"
"<a href=\"https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter\">https://"
"github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter</a>\n"
"to enable your ir emitter"
msgstr ""
"Mangyaring bisitahin\n"
"<a href=\"https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter\">https://"
"github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter</a>\n"
"upang paganahin ang iyong ir emitter"

#: src/onboarding.py:643
msgid "Setup lighting 1"
msgstr "Setup ilaw 1"

#: src/onboarding.py:644
msgid "Setup lighting 2"
msgstr "Setup ilaw 2"

#: src/onboarding.py:662
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "Hindi ma-save ang modelo ng mukha"

#: src/onboarding.py:667 src/onboarding.py:714
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "I-scan ang ikalawang model"

#: src/onboarding.py:673
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Hindi ma-record ang ikalawang model"

#: src/onboarding.py:674
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. The room must still "
"be bright enough to see your face — change the light rather than turning it "
"off — then try again, or skip and add a model later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Na-save ang iyong unang modelo, kaya gumagana na ang face login. Dapat ay "
"sapat pa rin ang liwanag ng silid upang makita ang iyong mukha — baguhin ang "
"ilaw sa halip na i-off ito — pagkatapos ay subukang muli, o laktawan at "
"magdagdag ng modelo sa ibang pagkakataon mula sa Mga Setting."

#: src/onboarding.py:708
msgid "Second scan: different lighting"
msgstr "Pangalawang pag-scan: ibang ilaw"

#: src/onboarding.py:710
msgid ""
"First model saved. Now change the light — for example turn a lamp on or off, "
"move away from the window, or use the other room light — keep your face "
"clearly visible, then press Scan again."
msgstr ""
"Na-save ang unang modelo. Ngayon, palitan ang ilaw — halimbawa, i-on o i-off "
"ang lampara, lumayo sa bintana, o gamitin ang kabilang ilaw sa kwarto — "
"panatilihing malinaw na nakikita ang iyong mukha, pagkatapos ay pindutin "
"muli ang Scan."

#: src/onboarding.py:752
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware and tools..."
msgstr ""
"Maaaring awtomatikong i-unlock ng Ubuntu Hello ang iyong {} gamit ang face "
"authentication (natukoy na wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Katayuan ng TPM:</b> Sinusuri ang hardware at mga tool ng TPM..."

#: src/onboarding.py:772
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> "
"automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Maaaring awtomatikong i-unlock ng Ubuntu Hello ang iyong {} gamit ang face "
"authentication (natukoy na wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Katayuan ng TPM:</b> Natukoy ang TPM hardware. Awtomatikong ini-install "
"ang <i>tpm2-tools</i>..."

#: src/onboarding.py:784
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active. Your password will be securely "
"sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Maaaring awtomatikong i-unlock ng Ubuntu Hello ang iyong {} gamit ang face "
"authentication (natukoy na wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Katayuan ng TPM:</b> Aktibo ang Hardware TPM 2.0. Ang iyong password ay "
"secure na selyuhan sa loob ng TPM."

#: src/onboarding.py:786
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, but automatic installation of "
"<i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. "
"Falling back to software-based credential caching."
msgstr ""
"Maaaring awtomatikong i-unlock ng Ubuntu Hello ang iyong {} gamit ang face "
"authentication (natukoy na wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Katayuan ng TPM:</b> Natukoy ang hardware ng TPM, ngunit nabigo ang "
"awtomatikong pag-install ng <i>tpm2-tools</i>. Patakbuhin ang <code>sudo apt "
"install tpm2-tools</code>. Bumabalik sa software-based credential caching."

#: src/onboarding.py:788
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detected. Using software-based credential "
"caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Maaaring awtomatikong i-unlock ng Ubuntu Hello ang iyong {} gamit ang face "
"authentication (natukoy na wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Katayuan ng TPM:</b> Walang TPM hardware na nakita. Paggamit ng software-"
"based na credential caching (AES-256-GCM)."

